---
title: Internal transfer - the single write path
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as web - Next.js
    participant H as api - HTTP handler
    participant B as Command bus
    participant I as Idempotency store
    participant P as Policy engine
    participant C as Compliance - VoP port
    participant S as Step-up port - SCA
    participant PM as payments module
    participant L as ledger - posting engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant A as Audit + Outbox

    U->>W: submits transfer form
    W->>H: POST /payments/transfers<br/>Idempotency-Key, correlation-id
    H->>H: authenticate, build Actor kind=user
    H->>B: execute TransferCommand, actor, key

    B->>I: lookup key
    alt key already seen
        I-->>B: stored response
        B-->>H: same body, same status
        H-->>W: 200 replay - nothing re-executed
    else new key
        I-->>B: miss, key reserved

        B->>P: evaluate actor, amount, currency, beneficiary
        alt deny
            P-->>B: deny with reason
            B-->>H: 403 policy violation
        else require approval
            P-->>B: require_approval
            B->>S: challenge
            S-->>B: verified - stub in v0
        else allow
            P-->>B: allow
        end

        B->>C: verify payee name vs IBAN
        C-->>B: match, close_match or no_match - stub in v0
        Note over B,C: on no_match the user is warned<br/>before execution - Instant Payments Regulation

        B->>PM: create payment, state=pending
        PM->>DB: insert payments row

        rect rgb(232, 245, 240)
        Note over B,DB: one DB transaction, SERIALIZABLE with retry
        B->>L: post_transaction debit source, credit destination
        L->>DB: insert journal_transactions
        L->>DB: insert journal_entries - 2 lines, sum = 0
        DB-->>L: deferred constraint checks balance at commit
        L-->>B: transaction id
        B->>PM: mark payment settled
        B->>A: audit row + outbox PaymentSettled
        A->>DB: insert audit_log, outbox
        end

        B->>I: store response against key
        B-->>H: TransferResult
        H-->>W: 201 Created
        W-->>U: real state rendered, never optimistic
    end
